{"repositoryId":1420722616,"availability":"available","full":"stepanbeseda/split-the-bill","name":"split-the-bill","description":"Split a restaurant bill item by item with friends – live, with payment QR codes. Built in about 20 minutes on a flight; your coding agent reads the receipt and deploys it.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-15T12:51:27Z","updated":"2026-10-15T13:08:33Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://split-the-bill-demo.netlify.app/b/demo","topics":["bill-splitting","claude-code","codex","netlify","qr-payment","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://split-the-bill-demo.netlify.app/b/demo","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T15:44:50.518Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T15:44:50.518Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T15:44:50.518Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T15:44:50.518Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Split a restaurant bill item by item – live, with payment QR codes. Operated by your coding agent.","Try the live demo → (pick a name on two phones and watch items disappear; it resets every hour)","One person pays, takes a photo of the receipt and hands it to Claude Code or Codex. A minute later the whole table gets a link: everyone taps what they had, items disappear as they are taken, and each person gets the exact amount – tip included – plus a QR code for their banking app."],"features":["Live and race-safe. Picks sync every few seconds. The server stamps changes and uses compare-and-set writes, so two","people grabbing the last beer at the same time cannot both get it.","Shared items. Mark an item shared and whatever nobody took for themselves is split among the sharers;","whole table splits it among everyone.","Exact money. Integer cents everywhere. The tip is distributed in proportion to consumption and shares are rounded"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/stepanbeseda/split-the-bill/blob/